{"id":"a0abc398f6f3118e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-partial-computable-random.md","title":"部分可计算随机性","display":"df-partial-computable-random — 部分可计算随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-partial-computable-random","aliases":["43-df-partial-computable-random"],"display":"df-partial-computable-random — 部分可计算随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-partial-martingale]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"§12.2, partial computable randomness","source_printed_pages":"328","source_pdf_pages":"348","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-partial-computable-random"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-partial-computable-random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-computable-random — 部分可计算随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§12.2, partial computable randomness"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"328"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"348"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a>。下式引入部分成功谓词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\iff\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;((X\\upharpoonright n,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(m)\\land v&gt;b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\iff\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;((X\\upharpoonright n,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(m)\\land v&gt;b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;(\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;(\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>成功只使用实际存在的有限实资本值。有限域或停止后未定义的节点不会人为贡献无穷资本。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：§12.2, partial computable randomness。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-partial-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$m$ 遍历 $2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-partial-martingale]]。下式引入部分成功谓词及 $\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)\\iff\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists v\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;((X\\upharpoonright n,v)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(m)\\land v>b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall m\\;(\\operatorname{PartialComputableMartingale}(m)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{PartialSucceeds}(m,X)).","display":true}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-partial-computable-random]] — 部分可计算随机性"},{"id":"ab85279fd837dade","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C(\\sigma\\mid n)$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$、$\\operatorname{PartialComputableRandom}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-condplainkolm]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]、[[43-df-partial-computable-random]]；$\\log_2$ 为二进制对数。所有阶函数的量化域为 $\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}$。"},{"id":"d6939d231a5b02cf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["df8eac4626d45afe"]}